# Sheriff of Safe Passage has Plot {1}{W} (CR 702.170a): on turn 1 Bot1 pays {1}{W} off Mox Pearl and Mox Jet and exiles it plotted (it cannot be cast the same turn). The
# counters are counted when it enters, not when it was plotted: Bot1 casts an Ornithopter on turn 1 after plotting, and on turn 3 the Sheriff is cast free from exile and enters
# with 1 + 1 = 2 counters, a 2/2, the Moxen untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Sheriff of Safe Passage
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sheriff of Safe Passage.Activate(Ability: Plot)
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Exile.Sheriff of Safe Passage.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Exile.Sheriff of Safe Passage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sheriff of Safe Passage.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Sheriff of Safe Passage.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = false
